+  // `.page-root { … }` at (0,1,0) loses the cascade and strikes nothing. This probe's first run
+  // read `12px` after the strike on both engines and looked exactly like the defect it is
+  // written to catch — a gate that cannot fail and a gate whose ablation does not land read the
+  // same from the outside, which is the whole lesson of C4.
+  await page.evaluate(() => {
